{
  "name": "Trellis: Session Track Generator (Lyria)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "trellis-session-track-generate",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Track Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_tracks",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            { "keyName": "id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $json.body.track_id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "generating" },
            { "fieldId": "updated_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Mark Generating",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/interactions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "x-goog-api-key", "value": "={{ $env.GEMINI_API_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: ($node['Track Webhook'].json.body.duration_seconds <= 45 ? 'lyria-3-clip-preview' : 'lyria-3-pro-preview'), input: $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.prompt, response_format: { type: 'audio' } }) }}"
      },
      "name": "Lyria Generate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "output_audio.data",
        "options": { "fileName": "track.mp3", "mimeType": "audio/mpeg" },
        "binaryPropertyName": "data"
      },
      "name": "Audio base64 to Binary (VERIFY path)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [770, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ 'https://horvjqqifgrzxesuxtfm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/music-sessions/' + $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.session_id + '/tracks/track-' + $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.track_number + '.mp3' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "audio/mpeg" },
            { "name": "x-upsert", "value": "true" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "inputDataFieldName": "data"
      },
      "name": "Upload Track",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [880, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "trellis_music_tracks",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            { "keyName": "id", "condition": "eq", "keyValue": "={{ $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.track_id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "completed" },
            { "fieldId": "storage_bucket", "fieldValue": "music-sessions" },
            { "fieldId": "storage_path", "fieldValue": "={{ $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.session_id + '/tracks/track-' + $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.track_number + '.mp3' }}" },
            { "fieldId": "audio_url", "fieldValue": "={{ 'https://horvjqqifgrzxesuxtfm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/music-sessions/' + $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.session_id + '/tracks/track-' + $node['Track Webhook'].json.body.track_number + '.mp3' }}" },
            { "fieldId": "audio_mime_type", "fieldValue": "audio/mpeg" },
            { "fieldId": "updated_at", "fieldValue": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Mark Completed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL", "name": "Supabase account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trellis: Session Track Generator (Lyria)\n\nOne track of a Trellis Session. Fired once per planned track by `sessionService.generateSessionTracks` (parallel, fire-and-forget).\n\n**Webhook:** `https://n8n.sproutify.app/webhook/trellis-session-track-generate`\n**POST body:** `{ track_id, session_id, branch, track_number, title, prompt, genre, mood, vocal_style, duration_seconds }`\n\n---\n### SETUP\n\n**Mark Generating & Mark Completed (native Supabase nodes):**\n- After import, open each and set **Credential → your Supabase account** (the placeholder id won't resolve).\n- Table `trellis_music_tracks`, match `id`, fields as pre-filled. No key pasting. ✅\n\n**Lyria Generate & Upload Track (HTTP):** the native node can't call Lyria or write Storage, so these stay HTTP. Two options for their secrets:\n1. **Env vars (default here):** set `GEMINI_API_KEY` and `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` in n8n (Settings → Environment, or the container env). The nodes already reference `{{ $env.* }}`.\n2. **Or** set each HTTP node's *Authentication → Predefined Credential Type* to your Google / Supabase credential and drop the header.\n\n**⚠️ Lyria node is a SCAFFOLD** — verify the model id / endpoint / request / response vs https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/music-generation. Lyria returns base64 audio → decode it to a **binary field named `data`** (Extract from File / Move Binary Data) before the Upload node.\n\n**Add an error branch:** on any failure, a Supabase Update setting `status='failed'` + `error_message` (the UI renders failed tracks with a Retry button).\n\n**Prereqs done:** `trellis_music_*` tables + `music-sessions` public bucket exist. When approved tracks are `completed`, the user hits **Stitch Approved** → `trellis-music-stitch` (Python worker, /workers).",
        "width": 580,
        "height": 640
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [100, -380]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Track Webhook": { "main": [[{ "node": "Mark Generating", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Mark Generating": { "main": [[{ "node": "Lyria Generate", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Lyria Generate": { "main": [[{ "node": "Audio base64 to Binary (VERIFY path)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Audio base64 to Binary (VERIFY path)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Upload Track", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Upload Track": { "main": [[{ "node": "Mark Completed", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  }
}
